* ======================================================================================================
* Device models for the PMB-H / LIB verification (ngspice). Every parameter traces to a datasheet value.
* ======================================================================================================

* ---- AO3400A  N-MOSFET 30 V (AOS datasheet: Vth 1.05 typ, Rds 18/19/24 mΩ @10/4.5/2.5 V,
*      Ciss 630p Coss 75p Crss 50p, Rg 3 Ω, Vsd 0.7 V @1 A). Level-1 core + external R fitted to the 3 Rds points.
.subckt AO3400A D G S
Rg G Gi 3
Rd D Di 8.4m
Rs Si S 8.4m
M1 Di Gi Si Si NCORE
Cgs Gi Si 580p
Cgd Gi Di 50p
Cds Di Si 25p
Dbody S D DBN
.model NCORE NMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=1.05 KP=96.3 LAMBDA=0.01)
.model DBN D (IS=1.5e-12 N=1.0 RS=0.02 BV=30 IBV=250u CJO=60p TT=10n)
.ends AO3400A

* ---- AO3401A  P-MOSFET -30 V (Vth -0.9 typ, Rds 41/47/60 mΩ @-10/-4.5/-2.5 V, Ciss 645p Coss 80p Crss 55p,
*      Rg 7.8 Ω, Vsd -0.7 V @-1 A)
.subckt AO3401A D G S
Rg G Gi 7.8
Rd D Di 18.4m
Rs Si S 18.4m
M1 Di Gi Si Si PCORE
Cgs Gi Si 590p
Cgd Gi Di 55p
Cds Di Si 25p
Dbody D S DBP
.model PCORE PMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=-0.9 KP=27.1 LAMBDA=0.01)
.model DBP D (IS=1.5e-12 N=1.0 RS=0.02 BV=30 IBV=250u CJO=60p TT=10n)
.ends AO3401A

* ---- diodes (fitted to datasheet Vf points)
.model SS34    D (IS=1.7e-7 N=1.1 RS=9.5m BV=40 IBV=0.5m CJO=150p M=0.5 VJ=0.4)
.model B5819W  D (IS=3e-6 N=1.05 RS=0.12 BV=40 IBV=1m CJO=50p M=0.5 VJ=0.4)
.model BAT54   D (IS=4e-9 N=1.0 RS=2.2 BV=30 IBV=2u CJO=10p)
.model BZT52C10 D (IS=1e-14 N=1 RS=1 BV=10.0 IBV=5m)
* SMAJ10A: VRWM 10 V, VBR 11.1-12.3 V @1 mA, Vc 17 V @ 23.5 A ; SMF5.0A: VRWM 5 V, VBR 6.4-7.0 V, Vc 9.2 V @21.7 A
.model SMAJ10A D (IS=1e-12 N=1 RS=0.23 BV=11.7 IBV=1m CJO=1n)
.model SMF5V0A D (IS=1e-12 N=1 RS=0.12 BV=6.7 IBV=10m CJO=1.5n)
.model ESD     D (IS=1e-15 N=1 RS=50)

* ---- PV module 6 V / 6 W, 12 mono cells in series (photo-measured; Voc 8.0 V, Isc 0.85 A @1000 W/m², 25 °C).
*      single-diode model per module: n = 1.3 per cell -> N = 15.6 for the string; Rs 0.25 Ω, Rsh = RSH param.
.subckt PV12 P N PARAMS: G=1000 RSH=3k
Iph N 1 {0.85*G/1000}
Dpv 1 N DPV
Rsh 1 N {RSH}
Rser 1 P 0.25
.model DPV D (IS=1.7e-9 N=15.6 EG=13.4 XTI=36)
.ends PV12

* ---- CN3791 behavioural model (datasheet: VMPPT 1.205 V, VCS 120 mV (21 mV precharge below 66.5 % VREG),
*      VREG 4.2 V, fosc 300 kHz, Dmax 94 %, DRV low = VCC-6.3 V, UVLO 3.8 V, sleep when VCC-VBAT < 20 mV, COM = gm error node)
.subckt CN3791 VCC GND DRV CSP BAT MPPT COM CHRGN
* ramp as a PULSE source so ngspice places a breakpoint at every cycle start
Vosc ramp GND PULSE(0 1 0 3.3233u 10n 0 3.3333u)
* three error terms (positive = room to increase duty); the smallest wins (like the wired-min error amps in the IC)
Bvcs vcsref GND V = V(BAT) < 2.795 ? 0.021 : 0.120
Bmin err GND V = min(min( 40*(V(MPPT)-1.205), 10*(V(vcsref)-(V(CSP)-V(BAT))) ), 10*(4.2-V(BAT)))
* transconductance amplifier into the external COM network (120 Ω + 220 nF), with anti-windup clamp 0..2.2 V
* anti-windup 0..2.2 V as 20 mV linear ramps (continuous: the err-sign switch happens where the current is zero anyway)
Bcom GND COM I = 0.5m*tanh(V(err)*10) * (V(err) > 0 ? min(1, max(0, (2.2-V(COM))/0.02)) : min(1, max(0, V(COM)/0.02)))
* enable: UVLO and sleep (VCC must exceed BAT by 0.32 V to start, stops below +0.02 V)
Ben en GND V = (V(VCC) > 3.8 && (V(VCC)-V(BAT)) > 0.02) ? 1 : 0
* PWM comparator: duty = (COM-0.2)/1.8, max 94 %
Bduty d GND V = max(0, min(0.94, (V(COM)-0.2)/1.8)) * V(en)
* continuous comparator (≈20 ns transition) — a hard if/else here makes the solver chatter when ramp = duty
Bpwm pwm GND V = 0.5*(1+tanh((V(d)-V(ramp))*150))
* gate driver: DRV = VCC (off) or VCC-6.3 (on), 5 Ω output, 40 ns edges
Bdrv drvi GND V = V(VCC) - 6.3*V(pwm)
Rdrv drvi DRV 5
Cdrv DRV GND 10p
* status: CHRG pulled low (open drain ~80 Ω) while charging
Schg CHRGN GND en GND SCHG
.model SCHG SW (VT=0.5 VH=0.1 RON=80 ROFF=100Meg)
* pin currents: VCC 1 mA operating, BAT 15 µA
Ivcc VCC GND 1m
Ibat BAT GND 15u
.ends CN3791

* ---- LM66100 ideal diode (datasheet: RON 91 mΩ @3.6 V, CE turn-on VCE-VIN < -150 mV (-80..-250), turn-off > +35 mV,
*      ST open drain low when disabled, reverse current blocking). Hysteretic comparator via an ngspice switch.
.subckt LM66100 VIN GND CE ST VOUT
Bctl ctl GND V = V(VIN) - V(CE)
* control > 0.15 -> enabled ; < -0.035 -> disabled
Ren en GND 1Meg
Venref vref GND 1
Sen vref en ctl GND SEN
.model SEN SW (VT=0.0575 VH=0.0925 RON=1 ROFF=1G)
* pass element: forward-only (reverse current blocking) with RON, only when enabled — continuous form (max) so the solver cannot chatter
Bpass VIN VOUT I = V(en) * max(V(VIN) - V(VOUT), 0) / 0.091
Dbody VIN VOUT DBODY
.model DBODY D (IS=1e-12 N=1.5)
* status: open drain low when disabled
Bdis dis GND V = 1 - V(en)
Sst ST GND dis GND SST
.model SST SW (VT=0.5 VH=0.05 RON=100 ROFF=1G)
.ends LM66100

* ---- ME6211C33 LDO: 3.3 V, dropout ~100 mV @100 mA (≈1 Ω), IQ 40 µA
.subckt ME6211 VIN GND VOUT
Bldo vo GND V = min(3.3, max(0, V(VIN) - 0.02))
Rout vo VOUT 1.0
Iq VIN GND 40u
.ends ME6211
